---
title: 村人が処刑されると霊能者の mediumHistory に human が記録される
setup: { medium: 1, werewolf: 1, villager: 2 }
rules:
  general.first-victim: none
---
# Day 1 投票で Carol (村) 処刑 → engine が auto-info:execution-species trait を
# 発動し、 生存中の Alice (霊) の mediumHistory[1] に
# { target: Carol, result: human } を push する。 Day 2 で Bob 処刑 → 終局
# (Day 2 以降は検証対象外、 Day 1 dispatch のみ検査)。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave
!Alice=霊能者
!Bob=人狼
!Carol=村人
!Dave=村人

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Alice→Carol
Bob→Carol
Dave→Carol
Carol→Alice

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Carol 3 / Alice 1 → execution=Carol
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 1 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Day 2:

Alice→Bob
Dave→Bob
Bob→Alice

# == engine: Day 2 ==
# vote tally: Bob 2 / Alice 1 → execution=Bob
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: villager_won
# survivors: Alice, Dave
# == end ==

# @expect-medium actor:Alice day:1 target:Carol result:human
